n: 9.5.1.5
kind: review
re: 3.1.1.5
saw: a8475c85
ack: 1
is: Run again from a fresh copy: the example and all 17 probes complete; test/sample.go, sample/test2.go and sample/sample.go each end in a nil pointer dereference, the last two at go.go:1010. For sample/sample.go the log holds 68 ASSERT lines before the panic and the dump 70 blueprint plus 477 recipe entries, 547 in all.
why: The 36 are the entries of the function-name table: 17 functions the file declares, 15 'CTOR:' initializer recipes of globals, 3 auto-declared callees (Itoa, Println, Sqrt) and 1 closure. Of the three helpers in debugging.go, <PREFIX>_ASSERT_ (5-10) and DEBUGBREAK_ (16-18) only log; <PREFIX>_Unhandled (12-14) panics.
by: r3/review-nums-core
at: 2026-11-24

